# ==============================================================================
# Benchmark Target Application (sample-ecommerce-app)
# ==============================================================================
# Benchmark target application. The SOURCE ships -- a calibration harness nobody else can
# run is not a calibration harness. What does not ship is anything regenerable or anything
# produced by a run, because committing a previous run's evidence would let the next one
# read the answers instead of finding them.
sample-ecommerce-app/node_modules/
sample-ecommerce-app/backend/data.sqlite
sample-ecommerce-app/state/
sample-ecommerce-app/test-artifacts/
sample-ecommerce-app
